    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c66c5d4a4b@example.invalid",
    "disclaimer-type": "text",
    "disclaimer": "<p> </p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Stroud N. J., DiPaola M. J., Martin B. L., et al,<br />\r\n“Initial Glenoid Fixation Using Two Different<br />\r\nReverse Shoulder Designs with an Equivalent<br />\r\nCenter of Rotation in a Low Density and High<br />\r\nDensity Bone Substitute,” J Shoulder Elbow Sur<br />\r\n(2013) 22, 1573-1579</li>\r\n<li>Anglin C., Wyss UP., et al., “Mechanical Testing of<br />\r\nShoulder Prostheses and Recommendations for<br />\r\nGlenoid Design,” J Shoulder Elbow Surg, 2000;<br />\r\n9:323-31.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>RU-AWI-2, 07-2017<br />\r\n</p>\r\n",
